- [38;5;10mfs_close[0m simply drops the [38;5;10mOwnedFd[0m, which closes the underlying file descriptor.[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mfs_chown[0m/[38;5;10mfs_lchown[0m use [38;5;10mstd::os::unix::fs::chown[0m/[38;5;10mlchown[0m (stable since Rust 1.73).[0m[0m
