- [38;5;10mfs_exists[0m returns [38;5;10mbool[0m matching the Rust signature (C version returned 0 for exists, -1 for not).[0m[0m
- Read functions ([38;5;10mfs_read[0m, [38;5;10mfs_nread[0m, [38;5;10mfs_fread[0m, [38;5;10mfs_fnread[0m) return [38;5;10mVec<u8>[0m matching the C behavior of reading raw bytes.[0m[0m
